<title>INDIA: Rallis India 96/97 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Rallis India 96/97 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rallis India Ltd posted a net profit of 228 million rupees ($6.37 million) in 1996/97 (April-March) against 222.7 million in the previous year, the Press Trust of India (PTI) reported on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>PTI said the company maintained its dividend in 1996/97 at 45 percent.</p>
<p>The company's total income from operations increased by 20 percent to 11.71 billion rupees in 1996/97 from 9.78 billion in the previous year, the news agency said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
